<title>USA: Orange and Rockland says Norstar deal ends.</title>
<headline>Orange and Rockland says Norstar deal ends.</headline>
<dateline>PEARL RIVER, N.Y. 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>NORSTAR Management Inc said Tuesday the deal with UGI Energy Services Inc has ended by mutual agreement, but its assets will remain on the market.</p>
<p>NORSTAR, an indirect subsidiary of Orange and Rockland Utilities, said the deal ended because of an inability to reach a definitive purchase agreement.</p>
<p>The company announced in June it entered into a letter of intent with UGI.</p>
</text>
